<title>INDIA: TABLE-Indian May foodgrains stocks 17.4 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Indian May foodgrains stocks 17.4 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian foodgrains stocks rose to 17.40 million tonnes in May from 16.41 million tonnes in April, and against 25.54 million tonnes in May last year, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    FOODGRAINS STOCKS    May 97	Apr 97	May 96</p>
<p>    Rice		     12.60	 13.17	  13.61</p>
<p>    Wheat		     4.80	  3.24	  11.93</p>
<p>    Total		    17.40	 16.41	  25.54</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of tonnes and preliminary. Stocks of coarse grains are included in the totals but not broken out separately.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
